WOW-BG3 benilla patch 0127: the figures BG3 draws are asked where they stand, indoors too (on top of 0126)

- entity_shade.rs: `ShadeOnlyRoot`, a shade root with no lit part of its own. benilla's interior classifier asks
  only anchors with lit parts whether they stand in a room or on a WMO's floor; the hidden roots of BG3's figures
  ("wowbg3 Tav", "wowbg3 companion N") have none, so their light chased the terrain's baked shadow under any
  building. `classify_shade_only_roots` asks the same question the same way (a unit's down-ray attach,
  `indoor_verdict_at`) when the root has moved or a building streamed in, and sets the root's indoor and on-WMO bits
  before `update_ground_shade` picks its target: day/night indoors, lit on a WMO floor, the MCSH sample elsewhere.
- wowbg3_tav.rs: both kinds of figure root carry it.

